// resolution and the single append inside the caller's serialized
// transaction. It is shared by the document-level restore and the
// session-scoped authorized restore so the two paths cannot drift: both take
// their snapshot miss (404 at the HTTP layer), conflict (409) and append
// decisions from one code path. The result's Created flag tells the caller
// whether a change-bearing transaction just committed and the push channels
